      "descriptionVerdict": "KEEP",
      "descriptionRationale": "Assessing the economic importance of dyes in industrial development is a coherent historical chemistry judgment. It can combine source evidence, interests, uncertainty and tradeoffs without actual laboratory execution or invented quantitative profits.",
