      "positiveEvidenceMaterialRationale": "The new actual-source case properly attributes BASF 1897 investment/research figures to company history, separates museum evidence about natural-indigo plantation labour and synthetic displacement, and requires uncertainty rather than fabricated financial returns. The 1901 Indanthrene fresh case does not imply guaranteed permanent market success. However its assessment boundary wrongly requires retained practical execution. P remains REVISE; this D KEEP does not close it.",
